{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231350","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231350","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1423135001:1":{"text":"The priestesses were coming for me... Sorry for the scare, everyone.","source_cn":"这些祭司应该是冲我来的……抱歉，让各位受惊了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4544B70188B4FED7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423135002:0":{"text":"Don't be, we dwarves have seen worse. Why were they after you?","source_cn":"受惊倒是没有，我们矮人也是见过世面的。她们为什么要袭击你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x728AAB261DD8F43A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423135003:1":{"text":"These priests used to serve under Priestess Velara, who colluded with Eldric.","source_cn":"这些祭司之前都是奎茵大祭司的手下，也就是与弗林达成秘密...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B124FDD96D24AF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423135004:1":{"text":"After Velara's defeat, these priests with powerful magic had nowhere to go... Eventually, some of them grew resentful and started a rebellion.","source_cn":"奎茵落败后，祭司们身负精深的魔力，却无容身之处……有些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x290A7FBA2F956266","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423135005:1":{"text":"Most commoners here can wield magic, but now, many of them are out of work...","source_cn":"萨洛克兰大多数的平民都能使用魔法，现在大量的平民失业……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDA13D016F436561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423135006:1":{"text":"Compared to the priests' rebellion, the people's livelihoods are the more pressing matter at the moment.","source_cn":"相比叛乱，更严重的是平民的生活没有着落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D782329B91C9A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423135007:1":{"text":"This is precisely why I'm committed to advancing our collaboration.","source_cn":"这也是我想推进合作的原因。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A97C50ABAABDAD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423135008:1":{"text":"In other words, you just want money from us.","source_cn":"简单点说，就是想从矮人这赚钱了呗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1F4884BD14F746F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423135009:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1423135010:1":{"text":"Ironbeard! Can you keep those crude comments to yourself?","source_cn":"铁须，不该说的你能不能少说点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F28C4C5CCC1F899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1423135010":{"text":"Ironbeard! Can you keep those crude comments to yourself?","source_cn":"铁须，不该说的你能不能少说点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F28C4C5CCC1F899","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1423135011:1":{"text":"Okay, okay... At least now I know these priests can use magic.","source_cn":"罢了……起码确定了这些祭司会用魔法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC729030ED32AC423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1423135012:1":{"text":"Let's check out other places.","source_cn":"走，我们再去其他地方看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD31F73CEFEA2617B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"Money works when it flows.","source_cn":"钱嘛，都是有来有往的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8116083799DC92B6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Money works when it flows.","female":"Money works when it flows.","variant_male_record_index":"73674","variant_female_record_index":"73675","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"The collaboration is a win-win.","source_cn":"要是合作成功，肯定会双赢的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3054F37AF292F1E0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"The collaboration is a win-win.","female":"The collaboration is a win-win.","variant_male_record_index":"73676","variant_female_record_index":"73677","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"Indris","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铁须":{"text":"Ironbeard","source":"铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:海拉":{"text":"Hyla","source":"海拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":3}}